 - Effects\n\n### SCSS\n\n`SCSS` styles are also included:\n\n* `skeleton-elements/skeleton-elements.scss` - All styles\n* `skeleton-elements/skeleton-block.scss` - Block component\n* `skeleton-elements/skeleton-text.scss` - Text component\n* `skeleton-elements/skeleton-effects.scss` - Effects\n\n## Usage\n\nSee the [documentation](https://skeleton-elements.dev) for more examples and API documentation.\n\n```html\n<style>\n  .user-avatar .skeleton-block {\n    width: 120px;\n    height: 120px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n</style>\n<div id=\"app\">\n  ...\n  <div class=\"user\">\n    <div class=\"user-avatar\">\n      <div class=\"skeleton-block skeleton-effect-fade\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"user-name\">\n      <span class=\"skeleton-text skeleton-effect-fade\">John Doe</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  ...\n</div>\n\n```\n\n## Contribution\n\nYes please! See the [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/nolimits4web/skeleton-elements/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md) for details.\n\n## Licence\n\nThis project is licensed under the terms of the [MIT license](https://github.com/nolimits4web/skeleton-elements/blob/master/LICENSE).\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","_id":"skeleton-elements@4.0.0-beta.1","_nodeVersion":"14.15.0","_npmVersion":"7.20.0","dist":{"integrity":"sha512-gj2Pqz02F71nC00Tu0peKc5LNsIgDZOT1rXtuuz2fm1Q8Q63sRaHw+/ld+DO9UK6dyxB7nJdryq3GqU/nuKAaQ==","shasum":"aa355d4a027dee44dee03b89df407ca24d26cea3","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/skeleton-elements/-/skeleton-elements-4.0.0-beta.1.tgz","fileCount":90,"unpackedSize":234658,"signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bwswu80PjjokCgh0o2w5c2U4LhQAE57gj9cz1kzA","sig":"MEQCIH/ETAGsCMIVQi6FPTrg740EJhrpUWnJ1jzNZYh0vpDYAiBMcoc9toMcY/UZE+SkhfLiSgVwoR822gQtdJYIky1SCA=="}]},"_npmUser":{"name":"nolimits4web","email":"nolimits4web@gmail.com"},"directories":{},"maintainers":[{"name":"nolimits4web","email":"nolimits4web@gmail.com"}],"_npmOperationalInternal":{"host":"s3://npm-registry-packages","tmp":"tmp/skelet